WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.000
Others weren't paying.

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.520
China didn't have to pay until 2030.

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:08.320
Russia was given an old standard that was easy to meet,

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:11.440
a 1990 standard.

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:12.600
But for the United States,

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:14.640
we're supposed to pay like a trillion dollars.

